{
 "_comment": [
  "Career calendar, grouped into named series by competition class.",
  "'series' is presentational: it groups the calendar screen and gives each",
  "class a name a player can say out loud. 'class' is the one that carries the",
  "entry rules - see data/classes.json.",
  "",
  "Unlocks are by series, not by single event: finishing any round of a series",
  "opens the whole of the next one. A chain that depends on one specific event",
  "is a trap, because a player can outgrow that event's class, or fail to field",
  "a car for it, and lose the rest of the calendar with no way back. Pacing",
  "comes from min_level, the class rating band and what the player can afford",
  "to field - all of which a player can act on.",
  "",
  "Payouts are generated from the winner's cheque on a fixed share ladder, so",
  "re-balancing an event means changing one number. Prize money also falls off",
  "each time an event is re-entered (EventSpec.repeat_scale), which is what",
  "makes the calendar, rather than one favourite event, the way to earn.",
  "Run tests/career_sim.tscn after changing anything here."
 ],
